{"id":"title-tmdb-920167","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"魔法使いの夜","overview":"Aoko Aozaki, una estudiante normal de secundaria, es realmente una bruja que vive en el mundo moderno… aunque aún es solo una aprendiz. Mientras, pasa los días junto con su compañera de piso, Alice Kuonji, esforzándose por convertirse en una bruja hecha y derecha...  La chica conoce a un chico.  Este es el comienzo de la historia de una joven, la historia de una bruja.","releaseDate":"2027-01-28","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPyunhbB86AeG7SBnV8oJwIEdmi.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/eTs5EnaQtnMDfwawMFDoVZLs7Fp.jpg","genres":["Animación","Fantasía","Drama"],"originalLanguage":"ja","spokenLanguages":["Japanese"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/eTs5EnaQtnMDfwawMFDoVZLs7Fp.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/x7OezdC1pLG64xWKNhjIDXY0GcQ.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ldada7pRjkWipG3KRjiaj4XpsOL.jpg","label":"Escena 03"}],"ratings":{},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"戸松遥","role":"Aoko Aozaki (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geVvuA2zMGE5xzfc20aDelJSelu.jpg","personTmdbId":1248340,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"花澤香菜","role":"Alice Kuonji (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UTBlNRopSOKyoWnCm74tyHOfR1.jpg","personTmdbId":119143,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"小林裕介","role":"Sojuro Shizuki (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4ukKDSobZJNuB4H3k89hkrKCDC.jpg","personTmdbId":1350418,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"梶川翔平","role":"Housuke Kinomi (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZccGkTo1lgdnDzBAH94B3i6ig5.jpg","personTmdbId":1255697,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"安済知佳","role":"Kojika Kumari (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk3Az9O67qrXR69rctwDDHWqi9d.jpg","personTmdbId":1324927,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"深町寿成","role":"Tobimaru Tsukiji (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb